  "name": "Stevedore strike at public ports, 4-19 March 2010",
  "description": "Historical validation case (spec 13.10). Day 4 = 4 March 2010, strike days 4-19 (16 days). Container and bulk handling stopped at all public ports (fuel 0.0, Naantali 0.5); trucked ro-ro cargo kept moving at the ferry ports Helsinki, Turku, Naantali, Hanko (food and medicine 0.5) and stopped elsewhere; the Porvoo refinery and its private port are unaffected. Stocks were built up on days 0-3 (x1.5 targets for food and medicine at regions and hubs) and mild hoarding followed on days 4-6. Factors and sources: SOURCES.md; comparison with observations: docs/validation/2010_port_strike.md.",
